            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "That's the third time today, Sleeping Beauty."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "How long was I out for?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "A dozen seconds or so."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "...Hoshiguma, step aside. I'll slash apart the debris."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Sorry, but I can't do that. If I move, we're both done for. Let me handle this."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Your shoulder."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "It doesn't matter."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "...You won't be able hold out much longer! You're holding up two floors' worth of rubble on top of your shield!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "I don't need to for much longer. Just until you woke up... Squat down, and get ready to dash out."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "No matter how heavy it is..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 1,
            "xstrength": 5,
            "ystrength": 3,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 50,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "...as long as I can turn it over..."
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 1,
            "xstrength": 5,
            "ystrength": 3,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 50,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "...it's not heavy at all!! AAAAAGH!!"
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 2,
            "xstrength": 8,
            "ystrength": 8,
