            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "You..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Gaaah, aagh... Ngh... It feels like I lost my shoulder just to give it that little push."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "You saved me again."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "What's weird about that? How many times does that make now? And don't say that to me so earnestly... makes me feel gross just hearing it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Let me rest a little. I feel like I just broke every bone in my body... Maybe it's your turn to let me take a nap."
    },
    {
        "command": "stopmusic",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member",
        "text": "...Blast, how did they even survive all that?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "playmusic",
        "params": {
            "intro": "$epic_intro",
            "key": "$epic_loop",
            "volume": 0.8,
            "crossfade": 1.5,
            "delay": 0.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Sure, but the enemy's not going to let you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "No rest for the wicked, I suppose. Looks like I can still stand if I muster my strength."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "You should go reorganize the squads, quickly. Don't waste any more time on them - it's what they're after."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$e_skill_skulsrsword",
            "volume": 0.5,
            "delay": 0
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "I don't think it's too late to just take them all out first."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Why can't you go check to see who got injured first?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "And leave you here to face Reunion alone despite all your injuries?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Ch'en. What do you think you're doing?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Two years ago in Hua Shui, you were chasing after a bandit leader. My leg was injured, but you believed in me and left me to fight alone. Do you still remember that?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "How long did it take me to catch him?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Three hours. You trusted me back then."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "And I still do."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "You, Reunion! I'll take you all on!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1011_wizard_1",
            "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member",
        "text": "Damn it... She's looking down at us!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "I can still fight. Why are you staying behind? Why aren't you taking the squads to recapture the L.G.D. Headquarters? Did you forget your main mission?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "It's the same as it was three years ago, and it's a responsibility that only you can fulfill!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "You did this back at the Muk Wo Warehouse earlier. When did you become so indecisive? Ch'en!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "I don't see any problem with protecting my colleague from these rioters."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "You've changed. You used to be much tougher."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Leaving you here? Of course I could. I used to only look at the risks versus the benefits, but now, it's as you said..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "After what I did to Amiya, I've also been... conflicted."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1011_wizard_1",
            "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member",
        "text": "You'll taste the rage of the Infected! Attack!"
    },
